# dark-and-scary -- horror. Dread first, jump-scares second.
# Atonal, close, wrong. Sounds that make you not want to open the door.
MATCH="darkandscary dark-and-scary darkscary horror scary terror dread creepy"
SFX_ADD="horror sound design, unsettling and wrong, close and intimate like it is right behind you, dissonant metallic resonance, wet organic undertone, dry and airless"
